  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationRecommendation</name>
    <id>4</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>We do not recommend that you change attributes. The rebate kind is already used in documents</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>توصیه نمی‌کنیم ویژگی‌ها را تغییر دهید. نوع تخفیف برگشتی قبلاً در اسناد استفاده شده است</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Реквизиты не рекомендуется изменять, вид ретро-бонуса уже используется в документах</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Özniteliklerin değiştirilmesi önerilmemektedir, retro bonusu türü belgelerde zaten kullanılmaktadır</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Không nên thay đổi mục tin, dạng thưởng lũy kế đã được sử dụng trong các chứng từ</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>We do not recommend that you change attributes. The rebate kind is already used in documents</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>We do not recommend that you change attributes. The rebate kind is already used in documents</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationRecommendationExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>22</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>DecorationRecommendationContextMenu</name>
      <id>5</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>Label</type>
    <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
    <skipOnInput>false</skipOnInput>
    <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
      <color>Web.FireBrick</color>
    </textColor>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
      <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
